ta\n5. Forecast reliability decreases beyond 30 days\n\n{\"=\"*80}\n                        FUTURE IMPROVEMENTS\n{\"=\"*80}\n\n1. Retrain monthly with actual updated sales data\n2. Incorporate external features (weather API, calendar events)\n3. Product-specific forecasting models\n4. Add prediction intervals for uncertainty quantification\n5. Implement automated retraining pipeline\n6. A/B testing of different model architectures\n7. Ensemble methods combining multiple models\n\n{\"=\"*80}\n                    DEPLOYMENT RECOMMENDATIONS\n{\"=\"*80}\n\n✓ Model Size:        ~10-20 MB (lightweight)\n✓ Prediction Speed:  <100ms per prediction (real-time capable)\n✓ Memory Usage:      <200MB (resource efficient)\n✓ Integration:       RESTful API endpoint\n✓ Maintenance:       Monthly performance monitoring recommended\n✓ Retraining:        Quarterly with new sales data\n\n{\"=\"*80}\n\nReport generated: {datetime.now().strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S')}\n\n{\"=\"*80}\n\"\"\"\n\nprint(report_content)\n\n# Save report\nwith open('Banelo_Sales_Forecasting_Report.txt', 'w') as f:\n    f.write(report_content)\n\nprint(\"\\n✅ Report saved to: Banelo_Sales_Forecasting_Report.txt\")"
